      The recoil is dependent on the mass of the gun and the mass and velocity of the bullet. A heavier gun will recoil less than a lighter gun for the same bullet.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section-card">
  <div class="section-header">
    <h2>Summary</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="section-content">
